  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrating Climate Action into Public Finance Management (PFM) systems</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;b&gt;The PFM Climate project&lt;/b&gt; aims to strengthen public financial management in support of climate resilience and sustainable development. It focuses on expanding the coverage and improving the quality of public services, enhancing the efficiency of public investments, and reinforcing the financial autonomy of the State. At the same time, the project contributes to the systematic integration of climate action and climate finance into national planning and budgeting processes, ensuring that environmental considerations are embedded in fiscal decision-making.</narrative>
  </description>
